{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026EKgFROuLZL1793248420.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上流傳一段影片，顯示有港鐵職員以極高效率協助乘客將掉落路軌的耳機順利拾回，過程相當流暢，獲得大批網民留言讚許。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-29-12h29m23s395.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026HnDQf5wkw21793248354.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>影片畫面顯示，一名乘客的無線耳機掉落在月台邊緣的隙縫下方。港鐵職員接報到場後，手持手電筒觀察位置，隨後蹲下並使用專用長柄夾工具，迅速且精準地將體積極小的耳機夾起並拿回月台上，整個過程前後不足十秒。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-29-12h29m29s752.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026hchGp0V7p91793248362.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>不少網民看過影片後，均被職員熟練的手法與效率吸引，留言大讚：「快、狠、準」、「訓練有素」、「咁細都夾到」，更有人打趣表示：「平時執唔少」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:21:13.394970+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:10.175152+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:22.323026+00:00","content_hash":"9ca28b00e544488b97e9332ea24322ddaf0472cb26e578b71f1ef95a9c9d020c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:21:13.394970+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}